; THE SPORE GALLERY - a square room with a soft middle.
;
; 7 by 7, and the shape is the point: the short way across is through the difficult ground, and
; the fast way round is the long way. The rock in the centre means nothing can be seen straight
; across it, so the two halves of the room fight each other before they meet.
;
; Four spawn slots and the encounter uses all four (CONTENT_PIPELINE.md P7).
;
;   .  floor      ~  difficult ground   #  rock      @  the hero starts
;   1-9 a spawn   |  wall up a line     -  wall along a line   x  door, shut   +  a corner

